**Nominal readings and the author draw (review F2/F3 of 2026-10-26, Codex finding 9):** the nominal P recall in the sham regime exceeds chance (lone 7 of 24 against 0.10) because the inserter draws authors from the documents' writing pools and reuses them (36 authors carry the 288 planted account-days); the 'P_honest_baseline' column (the planted account-days the honest world's P reviews anyway) shows how much of each nominal reading is the author's own standing. The pre-registered chance-band formula is passed; it does not by itself establish a chance-level null, which the attributable readings (the lead) do.

